Package: zucryptlink
Title: Static-Archive Consumer Fixture for zucrypt
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Not for release. Consumes zucrypt exactly as zuxlsx will,
    through LinkingTo alone: zucrypt.h comes off the LinkingTo include path
    and the installed libzucrypt.a is linked statically by ./configure, so
    there is no Imports entry and no run-time dependency on zucrypt. It
    exists so that a broken archive, a missing header, a configure that
    cannot find either, or a backend symbol leaking out of a consumer's
    shared object is discovered here rather than in zuxlsx. Its sibling
    tools/zucrypttest covers the other consumption mode, the registered
    function table.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LinkingTo: 
    zucrypt
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
